    "text": "In a meter bridge experiment, the circuit diagram and the corresponding observation table are shown in figure.<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0042_888642331e85.png\" /><table border=\"1px solid\">\t<thead>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th>S. No.</th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi>l</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></th>\t\t</tr>\t</thead>\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><br />\t\t\t<sub>1.</sub><br />\t\t\t<sub>2.</sub><br />\t\t\t<sub>3.</sub><br />\t\t\t<sub>4.</sub></td>\t\t\t<td><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>1000</mn></math><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>100</mn></math><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>10</mn></math><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>60</mn></math><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>13</mn></math><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>1.5</mn></math><br />\t\t\t<math><mn>1.0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br />Which of the reading is inconsistent?"
